OL,3,GNEWSALabour wants budget deal with
OL,4,APlaid Cymru government, says Ken Skates
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh Labour leader Ken Skates has
OL,7,Findicated he wants a budget deal with
OL,8,FPlaid Cymru ministers, while insisting
OL,9,Fthat additional learning needs (ALN)
OL,10,Ffunding remains his party's top
OL,11,Fpriority.
OL,13,FThe Welsh government's supplementary
OL,14,Fspending plans were defeated in the
OL,15,FSenedd in July after Labour refused to
OL,16,Fback proposed budget changes.
OL,18,FSkates said Labour was "keen still to
OL,19,Fnegotiate with the government" and
OL,20,Fstressed that "we really do need to
OL,21,Fhave cooperation to get budgets through
OL,22,Fthis place".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
