OL,3,GNEWSALabour wants budget deal with
OL,4,APlaid Cymru government, says Ken Skates
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaid minister Heledd Fychan said
OL,7,Fministers had already offered #120m
OL,8,Fover three years for ALN support and
OL,9,Fquestioned whether Labour had developed
OL,10,Fa plan to spend its proposed #100m
OL,11,Fpackage.
